0..81 Comment "/// This source compares a defined composite with `Path.step` at stuck endpoints."
82..85 Comment "///"
86..127 Comment "/// The `concat` body is `Path.step p q`."
128..186 Comment "/// A held call can supply an endpoint to either spelling."
187..190 Comment "///"
191..250 Comment "/// The machine evaluates the call where the type reads it."
251..299 Comment "/// The kernel repeats that endpoint comparison."
300..303 Comment "///"
304..340 Comment "/// - see: #4038 — stuck endpoints"
341..380 Comment "/// - see: #4005 — returned endpoints"
381..421 Comment "/// - see: #4011 — bind over transport"
